2.2.The Ministry of Chemicals and Fertilizers, by its notification dated 15.04.2021,
has stated that the for the following textile products, certification https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis under Bureau of Indian Standards (BIS) is mandatory:-
a) Polyester continuous filament fully drawn yarn (FDY);
b) Polyester partially oriented yarn (POY);
c) Polyester staple fibres;
d) Polyester industrial yarn;
e) 100% Polyester spun grey and white yarn.
In order to obtain the certification, time was granted for a period of 180 days from the date of notification and that was also extended by another 180 days on 08.10.2021.
